<text xml:lang="ta" type="edition">
  <body>
    <div rend="parallel">
      <p xml:id="Aink158-kilavi">
        maṟāmaṟporuṭṭu uṇṭikkālattu vāyilvēṇṭivanta talaimakaṟkut tōḻi kūṟiyatu.</p>    <p xml:lang="en">
        Spoken by the confidante to the hero who came, desiring to enter during meal time, for the reason of [him thinking they] will not refuse [him].
  </p>
</div>    
    <div rend="parallel">
      <lg xml:id="Aink159">
<l>veḷḷāṅ kurukiṉ piḷḷai cetteṉak</l>
<l>kāṇiya ceṉṟa maṭanaṭai nārai</l>
<l>pacitiṉa valkum paṉinīrc cērppa</l>
<l>niṉṉoṉ ṟirakkuve ṉallēṉ</l>
<l>ṟantaṉai ceṉmō koṇṭaviva ṇalaṉē</l>
      </lg>
      <lg xml:lang="en">
        <l>Oh man of the coast with cool waters, in which the wader with an inexperienced gait</l>
        <l>That went to see, since the hatchling of the white wader died,</l>
        <l>stays to eat [out of] hunger!</l>
        <l>I am not one to beg [even] one thing from you!</l>
        <l>Give back her innocence that you took, [and] go!</l>      </lg>
    </div>
  </body>
</text>
